# Per-developer Cargo overrides.
#
# A committed absolute target-dir makes the native app unbuildable everywhere else: a
# Windows "C:/rust_target/..." path was here, and on macOS and Linux cargo refuses
# outright, because "C:" parses as a path separator. Keep machine-specific overrides
# local.
src-tauri/.cargo/
